codex
The first structural attempt exposed a real semantic branch: a framed local map could hypothetically contain closure-cell metadata, so assignment branched into a cell write. I removed that over-general framing by initializing the loop’s temporary locals in the source and stating the invariant over the exact plain function frame. This tightens the theorem to precisely the actual translated program while preserving the full input domain.
